- What you need?
- I need this off you.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.113
- OK. OK. I'll send it to you.

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:14.447
- I'm not gonna put them
in the dryer.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:17.017
- Thanks, guys!
- I'm gonna wear them next week!

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:19.886
- Super Bowl. Super Bowl.
- We're going to the big one!

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:20.854
- Super Bowl.

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:22.822
- [Man 1:] Welcome
to the playoffs, baby.

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.124
- [Man 2:] Hey, these games
ain't for everybody!

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:25.191
These games are for the elite!

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:26.426
- [Man 3:]
Just give all you got!

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:29.029
- [Man:] You know what time
it is, Chiefs Kingdom.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.330
- [Announcer:]
The GOAT Tom Brady will make

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.799
his 43rd appearance
in a playoff game.

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:35.402
- TAMPA!

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:38.805
- Where else would you rather be
right now? Look at this.

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:42.509
- [Woman:]
Super excited to be here! Whoo!

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:44.010
- Let's go, Ravens, baby!

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.745
- [Announcer:] For Lamar
Jackson, he's either gonna

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:48.314
get over that playoff hump,
or the narrative will continue.

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:49.215
- Caw, caw!

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.384
- We're trying to work.
We're at work right now.

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:52.552
We just clocked in.

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:55.355
- Let's go, Buffalo!

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:59.526
- Let's go, Buffalo!
Let's go, Buffalo!

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:01.594
- Aah!
- Hell yeah!

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:03.496
- [Announcer:]
We are set to go.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.398
- Let's settle in, baby.

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:06.699
- I like this type of party.

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:08.435
- Yeah!

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:11.004
- Keep the camera on me, dawg,
cuz today I'm going crazy.

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:14.741
- I've been waiting
18 long years for this!

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:16.242
Go, Browns!

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.445
- Let's go get it done. Come on.
Championship mind-set.

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:19.846
Championship mind-set.
One play at a time.

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:21.281
- This time last year,

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:23.249
we was considered
the worst team in the NFL!

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:24.651
But look where we at now!

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:27.854
- Don't run.
- Just don't run, now.

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:29.689
Make sure you go wherever I go!

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:32.792
- Whatever you got tonight,
I got to have it!

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:33.760
I need it all!

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.162
- Nothing else in the past
matters but this moment.

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:37.931
- We talked about
being warriors.

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:39.766
Well, one way or the other,
that's what you are!

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:41.768
That's who you are!
That's what we are!

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.336
- Hey. One job. Let's win.

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:44.737
- "Win" on 3, 1, 2, 3.
- Win!

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:45.605
- Go, Bills!

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:47.407
- Man, win or go home.

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:48.975
- We ain't going home.
- I ain't trying to go home.

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:50.643
- I ain't trying to go home.
- Hell no.

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:51.911
- I ain't trying to go home.

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:53.780
- Playoff football, baby.
It's the only way to do it.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.082
- [Al Michaels:] And they start
with a horrible snap.

00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:59.119
And the Browns
wind up with a touchdown!

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:00.887
- 18 years
since our last playoffs,

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:05.391
and the Browns score a defensive
touchdown off a fumble.

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:07.327
I'm not getting off
this treadmill

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:08.595
for the rest of my life.

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:10.463
- [Announcer:] Hardman
standing in his 11-yard line.

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:14.300
Drops it! Muffs it!
Bills' ball on the 3-yard line.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.302
- Look at me. Hey. Look at me.
Hey. We're good.

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:18.605
Just be you. You're gonna
make a play this game.

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:19.906
- [Announcer:]
Brady has all kinds of time.

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:21.908
Throws toward the end zone.
Touchdown!

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:23.443
What a way to start
the football game.

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:25.178
- [Man:] Bucs strike first!

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:28.848
Oh, baby, we got a game
in Lambeau!

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:30.350
- [Announcer:] They throw it
left side to Hardman

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:33.319
on a wide receiver screen
into the end zone! Touchdown!

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:35.388
- Hey! That's how
you handle adversity!

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:37.023
You smack it right in the mouth!

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:39.192
- [Announcer:]
Quick toss. Davante's got it!

00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:40.760
And the Rams got crossed up!

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.563
- Jalen Ramsey, ya got burned!

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:44.831
- We got it. Let's go.

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:47.534
- [Announcer:] Steps up.
Pocket collapsing. He escapes.

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:50.503
Lamar Jackson to the 20.
Leg race. 10. 5.

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:54.174
- That's what we're talkin'
about! Easy money! Let's go!

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:55.708
- Easy money!
- Yeah! Ha ha!

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:58.845
- Yeah!

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:00.280
- Feel it, baby!

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:02.649
- Keep it going. Keep on going.

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:04.651
Hmm. Oh, yeah. Hell yeah.

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:09.422
♪♪♪

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:11.925
- Yeah!
- [Laughing]

00:03:11.925 --> 00:03:14.727
- [Announcer:] It's probably
gonna be a good couple of weeks

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:16.930
for folding table
and picnic bench makers

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.131
in the Buffalo area.

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:20.533
- They can take
their hats and T-shirts to Cabo!

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:22.769
- Still wanna laugh at us?

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:24.137
- You hear me?
- We're the same old Browns.

00:03:24.137 --> 00:03:25.205
Remember that.

00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:28.174
- You can TikTok
all the way to fishin', buddy.

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:29.943
You can fish all night long.

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:31.744
- Who can't win a playoff game?!

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:33.146
- [Man:] Lamar!

00:03:33.146 --> 00:03:37.550
Ohh! Ohh! Ohh! Ohh!

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:38.885
- I need something
from you, though.

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:40.320
- What you need?
- I need this off you.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.387
- OK. OK. I'll send it to you.

00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:43.022
All right, man.
Good luck to you.

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:45.024
- I'm tellin' you.
Y'all better wake up!

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:46.392
- I'm-a put the dagger in 'em.

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:48.127
- [Announcer:]
Throw the bubble. Picked!

00:03:48.127 --> 00:03:50.496
- Pick-six, baby! Yeah! Whoo!

00:03:50.496 --> 00:03:52.131
- [Steve Levy:]
Tannehill steps and fires.

00:03:52.131 --> 00:03:53.266
And it's intercepted!

00:03:53.266 --> 00:03:54.934
- Aah! Ha ha! Yeah!
Yee-yee-yee-yee-yee!

00:03:54.934 --> 00:03:56.803
- [Announcer:] They're out there
stomping on the logo.

00:03:56.803 --> 00:03:58.238
- The disrespect!

00:03:58.238 --> 00:03:59.405
- [Announcer:]
Pass is intercepted!

00:03:59.405 --> 00:04:00.640
It's the Honey Badger!

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:03.843
- You get a pick!
You get a pick! You get a pick!

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:04.978
- [Announcer:]
Picked off by Devin White.

00:04:04.978 --> 00:04:07.614
- Beatdown!
- We eatin' W's.

00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:08.948
- [Michaels:] Jackson fires.

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:12.018
And that will be intercepted
in the end zone

00:04:12.018 --> 00:04:13.620
