00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:16.856
And only Jackson
can stop him now.

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:20.393
Too late. To the end zone.
Touchdown!

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:21.861
- [Cris Collinsworth:]
And the Buffalo Bills

00:04:21.861 --> 00:04:23.963
have all of Buffalo rocking

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:26.899
like they haven't been rocking
in 20-some years.

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:28.701
- Always put the money on me.

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:30.370
- [Tracy Wolfson:]
It is official.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.305
The Chiefs will not have
Patrick Mahomes

00:04:32.305 --> 00:04:33.673
for the rest of this game.

00:04:33.673 --> 00:04:35.842
- [Announcer:] Chad Henne
coming into the game.

00:04:35.842 --> 00:04:37.744
- If somebody told you
it was gonna be hard,

00:04:37.744 --> 00:04:39.812
would you still want it?
Hell yeah!

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:42.715
- [Announcer:] If the Chiefs get
a first down, the game's over.

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:45.184
Henne scrambling
and comes to the near side.

00:04:45.184 --> 00:04:46.719
He's at the 40, 45, 50.

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:49.889
- Chad Henne, baby! Let's go!

00:04:49.889 --> 00:04:51.557
- [Announcer:] They snap it.
- There is a play.

00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:53.059
They're going for it.
They flood it right. Caught.

00:04:53.059 --> 00:04:55.361
Tyreek Hill. Stays in bounds!

00:04:55.361 --> 00:04:57.530
- Henne-thing is possible!

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.232
- [Announcer:]
Packers get a score here

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:02.168
and a 2-point conversion
to get this thing tied.

00:05:02.168 --> 00:05:04.804
Rodgers steps up, scrambles.

00:05:04.804 --> 00:05:07.140
Throws late over the middle.
Incomplete.

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.075
My goodness.

00:05:09.075 --> 00:05:10.376
- Oh. Kick-- Kick it.

00:05:10.376 --> 00:05:12.245
- [Announcer:] Wow. You would
have liked to have seen them

00:05:12.245 --> 00:05:13.246
get it done there.

00:05:13.246 --> 00:05:14.781
- Hey. We got three time-outs.

00:05:14.781 --> 00:05:16.516
- What?
- They're kicking a field goal.

00:05:16.516 --> 00:05:17.450
- Why?
- [Aikman:] I thought

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:20.253
that they would go for it
on fourth down.

00:05:20.253 --> 00:05:23.489
- [Man:] Me too, Troy. Me too.

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:25.992
- Need me to illustrate
why that's so dumb or--

00:05:25.992 --> 00:05:27.393
Now or later?

00:05:27.393 --> 00:05:29.195
- No penalties.
Take care of the ball.

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:31.364
Good routes. Everything.

00:05:31.364 --> 00:05:32.865
- [Announcer:] Do you have
a play in your playbook

00:05:32.865 --> 00:05:35.468
that will secure a first down
and a victory?

00:05:35.468 --> 00:05:38.004
Godwin running to the --
He's got the first down!

00:05:38.004 --> 00:05:40.940
- Let's go! Let's go!

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:44.644
- Argument closed!
Who's the GOAT? Tom Brady!

00:05:44.644 --> 00:05:47.613
-I really look up to you too, man.
Man, keep your head up.

00:05:47.613 --> 00:05:50.249
- [Romo:] What a season
by Cleveland getting here.

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:51.951
- [Nantz:] I know there
are hearts broken today,

00:05:51.951 --> 00:05:54.387
but they're not
the same old Browns anymore.

00:05:54.387 --> 00:05:56.356
- You've done a hell of a job.
That's the most important thing

00:05:56.356 --> 00:05:58.858
right there, huh?
Most important thing.

00:05:58.858 --> 00:06:00.360
- Good luck, man.
- Thank you.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.294
- Go get another one!

00:06:01.294 --> 00:06:03.863
- [Man:]
This is the proudest I've been

00:06:03.863 --> 00:06:07.033
of this team in almost 30 years.

00:06:07.033 --> 00:06:10.837
- I'm off to the store
because I need ice cream.

00:06:10.837 --> 00:06:12.405
Chocolate ice cream.

00:06:12.405 --> 00:06:14.540
- [Announcer:] You can't help
but wonder as we watch

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.809
Drew Brees walk off
this football field --

00:06:16.809 --> 00:06:20.980
is this the final time that
we're gonna watch Drew do this?

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.316
- [Announcer:] Tampa Bay
Buccaneers are going to be

00:06:23.316 --> 00:06:25.952
the first team ever
to host a Super bowl!

00:06:25.952 --> 00:06:28.821
- [Crying]
I waited so long for this.

00:06:28.821 --> 00:06:30.857
- There's a ceremony?
- Yeah.

00:06:30.857 --> 00:06:32.225
- There's like a ceremony?

00:06:32.225 --> 00:06:33.192
- I'm new to this, man.

00:06:33.192 --> 00:06:35.428
- We're coming home,
and we're coming home to win.

00:06:35.428 --> 00:06:36.596
- We still ain't played
our best yet.

00:06:36.596 --> 00:06:39.399
- Nope.
- We going again, baby!

00:06:39.399 --> 00:06:40.566
- I'm back!

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:42.101
- [Announcer:]
Back-to-back AFC titles.

00:06:42.101 --> 00:06:43.970
- We back!
- Let's go!

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:47.673
Aaaah!

00:06:47.673 --> 00:06:52.445
- [Romo:] It's Mahomes/Brady.
Super Bowl!

00:06:52.445 --> 00:06:54.414
- I'll see y'all in Tampa Bay!

00:06:56.549 --> 00:06:58.251
- [Woman:] Ohh!

00:06:58.251 --> 00:07:00.520
- There he goes.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.488
- Ohh!
- Ohh!

00:07:02.488 --> 00:07:04.090
- I could've used you tonight!

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:07.927
- Tommy, if you're watching,
which I know you're not,

00:07:07.927 --> 00:07:09.462
we're coming for you
in two weeks.

00:07:09.462 --> 00:07:11.364
- No more "Suck-aneers" no more.

00:07:11.364 --> 00:07:14.634
I don't want nobody
calling us Suck-aneers anymore.

00:07:14.634 --> 00:07:16.769
- Have fun.
Be nice to your sister.

00:07:16.769 --> 00:07:17.637
- No!

00:07:17.637 --> 00:07:20.973
- Yes. Be nice to your sister.
See you, boys.

